1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:02,430
Ask your AI for a game.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:05,670
A space mystery takes
shape out in deep space.

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:08,410
A ship, abandoned stations,

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,630
and a clue waiting to be found.

5
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,990
Starting with shared foundations,

6
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:15,990
ask for 3D interiors
and a robot companion.

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,650
Together, you approach the station

8
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,510
across its long exterior walkway,

9
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,370
ready to step inside and explore.

10
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,130
Then rescue the crew.

11
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,570
Work the console to send a signal.

12
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,550
The beacon comes alive,

13
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:30,270
lighting up the station around you

14
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,810
and a new mission brings the crew

15
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:32,980
back into the story.

16
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,790
With permission and creator credit,

17
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:36,810
share its foundations for someone else.

18
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,510
One player imagines an underwater mystery

19
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:42,070
with familiar structures
transformed beneath the waves

20
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,650
built from the same beginnings.

21
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:46,370
Another player turns them
into a cooperative rescue

22
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:47,540
above the clouds,

23
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:48,910
made for friends to play together.

24
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:50,780
Games don't die.

25
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,330
Possibilities multiply

26
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:54,190
as one world becomes a
beginning for another.

27
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:56,120
Game Commons.

28
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:57,440
whatever you want to play,

29
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,820
just ask your AI.
